Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all your fault that Lady Venus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed! Ed! Stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You can't die, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, hold on! Brother! BROTHER!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that now, you'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed, I'm glad I got to meet all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After Father died, I was all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me many things,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but what made me happiest...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,was when you called me a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.15,0:02:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget about you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed, promise me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always be friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,SOPHIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Al, what happened to Sophie!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.65,0:03:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie! Hey, Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!? Sophie!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Al, it can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Why did you do that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,WHY, DAMMIT!?
